{"speciesId":630,"names":{"fr":"Vaututrice","es":"Mandibuzz","en":"Mandibuzz","ja":"バルジーナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il construit des nids en os. Il attrape les proies affaiblies avec ses serres et les transporte allègrement au nid."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It makes a nest out of bones it finds. It grabs weakened prey in its talons and hauls it to its nest of bones."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il guette le sol depuis les airs et fond sur les proies affaiblies. Il aime s’apprêter avec des ossements."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Watching from the sky, they swoop to strike weakened Pokémon on the ground. They decorate themselves with bones."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot prey, they attack and carry it back to their nest with ease."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot prey, they attack and carry it back to their nest with ease."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il tournoie dans les airs en quête d’une proie sur laquelle il fondra avant de l’emporter avec aisance à son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vuela en círculos. Cuando avista una presa, la ataca y la transporta a su nido con suma facilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot prey, they attack and carry it back to their nest with ease."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大空で 円を描きつつ 飛び 獲物を みつけると 襲いかかって 巣まで 軽々と 運んでいく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il guette le sol depuis les airs et fond sur les proies affaiblies. Il aime s’apprêter avec des ossements."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Otea la superficie desde el cielo y ataca a Pokémon debilitados. Tiene por costumbre hacerse adornos con huesos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Watching from the sky, they swoop to strike weakened Pokémon on the ground. They decorate themselves with bones."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"空から 地上を 観察して 弱った 獲物に 襲いかかる。 骨で 着飾る 習性。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il tournoie dans les airs en quête d’une proie sur laquelle il fondra avant de l’emporter avec aisance à son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vuela en círculos. Cuando avista una presa, la ataca y la transporta a su nido con suma facilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot prey, they attack and carry it back to their nest with ease."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大空で 円を描きつつ 飛び 獲物を みつけると 襲いかかって 巣まで 軽々と 運んでいく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il guette le sol depuis les airs et fond sur les proies affaiblies. Il aime s’apprêter avec des ossements."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Otea la superficie desde el cielo y ataca a Pokémon debilitados. Tiene por costumbre hacerse adornos con huesos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Watching from the sky, they swoop to strike weakened Pokémon on the ground. They decorate themselves with bones."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"空から 地上を 観察して 弱った 獲物に 襲いかかる。 骨で 着飾る 習性。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les Vaututrice femelles se parent d’ossements pour leur parade nuptiale. On attend toujours de découvrir si les mâles existent ou pas."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se dice que los huesos con los que se engalana le sirven para cortejar al otro sexo, aunque nunca se ha avistado ningún Mandibuzz macho."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They adorn themselves beautifully with bones. This is supposedly an effort to attract males, but no male Mandibuzz have ever been found."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"骨で 綺麗に 着飾るのは ♂に アピールするためと いわれるが バルジーナの ♂は みつかっていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il tournoie, haut dans le ciel, à la recherche d’un Pokémon affaibli. Sa proie favorite est le petit Osselait."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Revolotea por el cielo en busca de un Pokémon débil al que convertir en su presa. Tiene una particular debilidad por los Cubone."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It circles in the sky, keeping a keen eye out for Pokémon in a weakened state. Its choicest food is Cubone."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"大空を 旋回 しながら 弱った ポケモンを 狙っている。 大好物は カラカラ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il utilise avec dextérité les ossements de ses proies pour construire son nid. La plupart de ces os appartenaient à des Osselait."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Utiliza con pericia los huesos de las presas que devora para así construir un nido. La mayoría de los huesos pertenecen a los Cubone."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It skillfully arranges the bones of its prey to construct its nest. Most of the bones are Cubone."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"食った 獲物の 骨を 使って 器用に 巣を 作る。 多くの 骨は カラカラの ものだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est toujours à la recherche de nourriture pour Vostourno. Quand il trouve un Pokémon affaibli, il fond sur la proie et l’emporte dans son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Busca sin cesar comida para alimentar a Vullaby. Atrapa al instante a cualquier Pokémon debilitado que aviste y lo lleva al nido."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s always searching for food for Vullaby. When it finds a weak Pokémon, Mandibuzz swoops it right off to its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"バルチャイの ために いつも エサを 探している。 弱った ポケモンを 見つけ次第 巣まで 連れ去るぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Malgré son naturel brutal, il recueille volontiers les Vostourno égarés et prend soin d’eux jusqu’à ce qu’ils soient en âge de quitter le nid."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"A pesar de su carácter violento, si avista un Vullaby perdido, lo acoge en su nido y lo cuida con esmero hasta que está listo para partir."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Although it’s a bit of a ruffian, this Pokémon will take lost Vullaby under its wing and care for them till they’re ready to leave the nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"荒っぽい 性質だが 迷子の バルチャイを 見かけると 巣立つまで 大切に 面倒を みる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se pare d’ossements qu’il a ramassés. Il semblerait qu’il choisisse la forme des os qu’il porte selon les dernières tendances."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se engalana con los huesos que va recogiendo. Al parecer, la elección no es casual, sino que obedece a los dictados de la moda."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"They adorn themselves with bones. There seem to be fashion trends among them, as different bones come into and fall out of popularity."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"拾った 骨で 身を 飾る。 まとう 骨の 形には 流行が あるらしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":630,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[11,"level-up",57],[14,"level-up",57],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",57],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",57],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",57],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",57],[20,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0